  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "feat(generator): implement map-reduce pipeline and class-level generation\n\n      - Redesign source generator architecture to a Map-Reduce (Lego-block) pattern, removing complex stateful property pipelines.\n      - Support merging multiple attributes on a single property (e.g.,Decorators + Owners) by grouping and joining CodeFragments based on a Priority system.\n      - Expand SyntaxProvider target to include `TypeDeclarationSyntax`, enabling code generation for outer members (class/struct level).\n      - Introduce a smart fallback mechanism: automatically inject private backing fields and default get/set logic for properties that only utilize decorator attributes.\n      - Eliminate string manipulation bugs by treating all generated outputs as standard block bodies rather than parsing expression bodies.",
